        "original_id": "af3336c0-f1fa-5de2-9b15-bf87fb9257b4",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Works: Domestic Disturbance, Monsters, Inc. franchise, Forgiven, Chinese Coffee\n- People: Harold Becker, John Travolta, Vince Vaughn, Teri Polo, Steve Buscemi, Matt O'Leary, Susan Floyd, Al Pacino, Jerry Orbach\n- Roles: Director, cast member, voice actor\n\nFacts:\n- Domestic Disturbance is a 2001 American psychological thriller film directed by Harold Becker, and it was his last film to date.\n- Domestic Disturbance stars John Travolta, Vince Vaughn, Teri Polo, Steve Buscemi, and Matt O'Leary.\n- Steve Buscemi provides the voice of Randall Boggs in the Monsters, Inc. franchise.\n- Susan Floyd had a featured role in Domestic Disturbance.\n- Susan Floyd also had a featured role in Forgiven.\n- Susan Floyd starred opposite Al Pacino and Jerry Orbach in Chinese Coffee.",
